WEBVTT

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.520
Mermaid Princesses.

00:01:40.850 --> 00:01:44.220
Be absorbed into my body and become a part of my power!

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:50.070
The Battle on Christmas Eve

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.160
Lucia! Wake up, Lucia!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:01:59.100
Seira!

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:03.300
Please, Lucia. Don't think of Mikeru as someone you have to defeat.

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:06.840
Huh? What do you mean by that, Seira?

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:11.020
I understood after being inside Mikeru's heart.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.450
Mikeru is actually living a miserable existence.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.130
Look at this, Lucia.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.520
Mikeru is suffering because of this fossil.

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:19.650
He's bound to it.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.320
If this fossil didn't exist, he could be free.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.050
So you're saying that Mikeru is suffering, Seira?

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.790
That's {correct}right, Lucia.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:32.280
When I was absorbed into his body, I thought of him as a hated enemy.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:37.020
But when I learned of his suffering, I thought of him differently.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:43.510
{Because everyone was trying to defeat him, our songs will not penetrate his heart.}We've been trying to defeat him, but our songs won't reach his heart.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.360
Please, Lucia. Save Mikeru!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:54.020
That's right. I might have forgotten something.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:59.180
It doesn't matter if you're a human, a mermaid, a member of the Panterassa race, or even you, Mikeru!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.110
We're all beings living on this planet.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.450
Silence! This beautiful planet has been corrupted.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.790
I can never live with humans!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:10.920
Lucia...

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:11.630
Rina!

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:14.510
Sympathy is wasted on him.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:15.480
That's right!

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.380
Hanon!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.620
He's not going to understand!

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:23.600
{Mikeru is not blaming himself, but is blaming the humans instead on what happened to this planet.}Instead of blaming himself, Mikeru is blaming the humans for what happened to this planet.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:25.690
It's very sad.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:27.840
We have to defeat this {bastard}guy!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.920
You {cheeky}insolent Mermaid Princesses!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:38.070
Now, Mikeru-sama! Exterminate the humans who have corrupted this planet and revive the ancient ones!

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:41.310
That's right. I'm going to revive the ancient ones.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.740
I will enslave the Mermaid Princesses.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.740
I will restore the beauty of this {planet}world!

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.490
Noelle!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:59.350
Mikaru! Are you still within Mikeru's body!?

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:01.320
Please! Answer me, Mikaru!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:02.750
Mikaru?

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:06.040
Hasn't she been {already }completely absorbed into Mikeru's body?

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:07.620
Huh?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.800
This light is...?

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.810
