00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.570
Kaito!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.320
Sorry to keep you waiting, Lucia.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.950
Hey! You're really late, Kaito-kun!

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:29.470
Kaito! {Didn't you have the}Isn't it your duty to protect Lucia?

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:33.780
Yup! I've come here to help you, Lucia!

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:35.310
Kaito!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:39.700
{In addition}Plus, I'm here to rescue Mikaru from being {captured}trapped in{to} Mikeru's body!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.400
Hmph! Mikaru is {already completely}fully absorbed into my body.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.560
It's too late for you to do anything now.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:03.440
That's the power of the Panterassa race!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.350
Stop! The ancient ones and your race have no {association}quarrel with each other!

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.360
Why are you also here to interfere with me!?

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:15.920
Mikaru! I {would like for}want you to forgive me!

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.290
I'm an useless older brother for not being able to {rescue}save you!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.910
{However,}But I will not run away again!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:24.440
Answer me, Mikaru!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:28.170
Mikaru! You're still inside Mikeru's body, aren't you?

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.620
Your consciousness must still be in there!

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:32.150
Answer me, Mikaru!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.850
No matter what you do, it's {worthless}useless.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.070
Mikaru's consciousness no longer exists{ anywhere}.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.010
Kaito...

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:40.700
Oh!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.360
Mikaru!

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:46.130
How's that possible? Mikaru has been completely absorbed into my body!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:49.600
Why does her consciousness still exist?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.450
Onii-sama.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.820
Mikaru! You're still alive!

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:57.590
Just hold on! I'm going to rescue you!

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.490
{Turn back.}Go away.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.270
{Turn back!}Go away!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.770
