00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.390
What you're talking about is not true tranquility!

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:31.250
Go away, Kaito!

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.910
Just stop talking and turn back home!

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.340
I beg {of }you!

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:38.040
Come back to us, Mikaru!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.490
Return to our world!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:46.900
Why? Why do you have to be so kind, Kaito?

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.910
Even now, my feelings for {Kaito}you haven't changed.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:57.800
You love that boy so much only because he is of the same Panterassa race as you are.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.430
You're wrong. That's not {the case}true.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.870
It's because I need Kaito's heart...

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:06.270
Hearts are a deception!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:08.340
It doesn't matter if they're mermaids or members of the Panterassa race.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:10.170
They're just trying to bait us!

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:14.820
Then what's this warm feeling that's in your chest{ comes out of your breast}?

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:17.600
What's this feeling of sadness and suffering?

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.100
I have no companions!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.350
You and I are one being.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:25.840
We'll always live a solitary existence!

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:27.320
You're lying.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:32.170
You also feel that you're no longer alone.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.090
SILENCE!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.900
This flame is...

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:01.880
Rihito? Is that you, Rihito?

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.560
