00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:07.110
That's right. It's me.

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.640
I knew it was you!

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.500
What did you do to Mikaru!?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.530
I just wanted Mikaru to be happy.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.420
That's all I wanted!

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:21.400
You wanted her to be happy. Was {it only that}that it?

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.480
You've made Mikaru into such a monster!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.020
Is that something {befitting a father}a father would do!?

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.560
Back then, Mikaru was extremely ill.

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:34.520
People thought that she was about to die.

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:40.240
At that time, during an expedition around the South Pole, I found something {that }I couldn't believe.

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:44.830
I found the fossil of someone from an ancient race. That was Mikeru.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:49.640
The servant that was next to it whispered devilishly in my ear{ in an demonic fashion}.

