00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.280
"I will save Mikaru." I trusted those words.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:14.920
Mikeru and Mikaru originally were meant to {replenish}complement each other.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.310
{However,}But in reality, that didn't happen.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.550
