00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.780
{Now, without knowing}For some reason, Mikaru's heart and Mikeru's cells are now rejecting each other.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:32.220
{In the end, the result is an}And this is the unhappy result.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.750
How could you do something {this foolish}so stupid?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:43.250
I trusted in that servant and thought that this would make Mikaru healthy again. I was a fool!

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.930
It's too late to regret your actions!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:49.420
Did you think about how much suffering you've caused Mikaru because of this!?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.070
Now, return Mikaru to what she was!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.690
You know how to separate Mikeru and Mikaru!

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.980
I think I know of a way.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:07.700
However, is it really a good idea to separate them now?

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:11.350
Will it cause Mikaru more suffering?

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.460
Why in the {hell}world are you hesitating!?

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.990
You think that Mikaru is happy right now?

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:23.110
{The source of }Mikeru's heart is located within {Mikeru's}his fossil {that's }at the bottom of this DNA tower.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.660
If I destroy it, maybe...

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.090
What are you planning to do?

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.990
Forgive me, Rihito! Take care of Mikaru for me!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.360
I'm sorry, Mikaru.

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:54.400
My heart... the source of my heart...

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.340
How could that father be so stupid?

00:10:56.340 --> 00:11:00.300
By doing that, my duty to the ancient ones is...

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.560
Mikeru-sama!

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:12.670
According to him, that might have been the only way.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:15.020
This might have been his indirect way of {doing}fixing things.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:18.820
{However,}But I understand that you loved Mikaru, Father.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.990
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.970
T-This is...

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:39.700
Mikeru must have been freed when his fossil was destroyed.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.620
Look at that.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:54.730
Seira's heart shards are coming together from among Mikeru's feathers.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.150
{Seira's}Her soul has been freed from Mikeru's body.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:02.110
Seira... you've finally been born!

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.170
Orange Pearl Voice!

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:15.840
Thank you, Lucia, Hanon, Rina, Karen, Noelle, Coco.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.660
Congratulations, Seira! I'm really glad!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:21.920
Lucia-chan.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:24.130
Rihito-san!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:27.090
Was this child {imprisoned}trapped in Mikeru's body?

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:27.780
Yeah.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:31.530
Then there's still a chance that Mikaru can be rescued as well.

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:32.680
In order to do that...

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:33.220
Huh?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:36.760
In order to do that, you need to rescue Mikeru's heart!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.450
Mikeru's heart?

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:42.250
I've been in Mikeru's heart, so I understand what's going on.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:46.360
Both Mikaru and Mikeru have hearts full of sadness.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.850
His heart is full of sadness at the destruction of his ancient race,

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:55.050
and he's had to endure this alone in that cold fossil for tens of thousands of years.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:59.170
I see. Both Mikaru and Mikeru are really lonely.

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:03.400
That's why Mikaru wanted someone kind-hearted like Kaito to support her.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:23.490
Mikeru-sama! You've been here {all this time}this whole time, haven't you?

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:25.360
