00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:45.520
You have a duty to revive the ancient race so this world can be reborn!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:49.140
Is it worth the sacrifice of {this}so many lives {in my duty for the world to be reborn}to fulfill my duty of rebuilding the world?

