00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:44.880
I want to do something for them!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.460
I want to rescue them!

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:49.600
I want to rescue Mikaru and Mikeru!

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.070
