00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:02.080
This singing is...

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.590
Mikeru, I'm not alone.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:17.880
{That's because there are so many people who care for me and are singing for me!}There are so many people who care and are singing for me!

