Even if you're saved, I will still be alone.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:26.630
That's right!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.490
{Therefore,}That's why the ancient ones must be revived!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.530
{You must not sing with a heart of hatred and the intention to defeat someone.}You mustn't sing with a hateful heart,

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:39.160
intent on defeating others.

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:42.500
{We need to let them understand that they will not be alone from now on!}We need to let them know that they will never be alone anymore.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:45.850
Now, sing, Mermaid Princesses!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.290
T-This is...

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.330
Somehow, there's something in my chest.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.620
It's warm and gentle.

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:36.660
It's... It's so huge!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.470
It's growing so fast in my heart!

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.740
I feel it!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:47.330
Mikeru! You're not alone!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:49.750
Who? Who are you?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.680
Mikeru, everyone is thinking of you.

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:54.980
