00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:49.900
{Oh}Aww!

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:53.220
Rihito-san! This baby is...

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:57.920
Yeah. I remember the day Mikaru was born.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:02.100
There is no mistake about it. This {infant}child is Mikaru.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.990
Mikaru-chan.

