Yeah, she definitely will.

00:23:52.080 --> 00:23:54.010
Kaito! Wait for me!

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:57.450
{Haha! }You're too slow, my cute mermaid!

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.650
I got you! I'm not going to let you go!

00:23:59.650 --> 00:24:01.460
I love you, Lucia.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:04.010
Kaito, I'm really happy!

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:05.160
It's like a dream!

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:07.050
Not yet! There's more to come!

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.190
Yeah, you're right. It's...

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:11.470
...our future.

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:15.540
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure: the final episode.

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:16.940
Onward to That Dream.

